\mathrm{RH}^{\bullet}(A,F^{\bullet}) = \mathrm{R}\varprojlim_{A^{o}}\ (F^{\bullet}) \quad ( = \mathrm{R}\Gamma_{A}(F^{\bullet})\hand{)} \ : \quad D^{+}(A^{\wedge}_{\hand{\mathcal{M}}}) \hand{\to \mathcal{M}} \\
